# Observability

- ingest-api Actuator: liveness plus Kafka connectivity.
- analytics-service Actuator: liveness plus Kafka and PostgreSQL.
- Structured logs. Never log secrets, passwords, or tokens.
- Correlation IDs on request logs when practical. No mandatory distributed tracing in v1.

# Performance
Paginate samples. Aggregate in SQL. Do not load full time ranges into memory. Do not optimize blindly.
